{"id":"613512","name":"酸菜馅饼","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/613512/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酸菜","amount":"两把"}],"sub":[{"name":"香葱","amount":"一把"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"酸菜备用。","img":"images/613512/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"挤出多余的水分，剁碎。","img":"images/613512/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"香葱摘好，洗净，切碎。","img":"images/613512/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入盆中。","img":"images/613512/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加适量盐少许鸡精，浇一勺热油，拌匀即可。","img":"images/613512/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"一半凉水和面，一半温水和面，用筷子搅拌成絮状，醒15分钟，揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/613512/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搓成长条状，切成大小均匀剂子。","img":"images/613512/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"擀成圆薄饼。","img":"images/613512/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/613512/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"已包好，如图所示。","img":"images/613512/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"再擀成薄圆饼。","img":"images/613512/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"已擀好，如图所示。","img":"images/613512/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"平底锅烧热，放入饼胚。","img":"images/613512/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"小火，烙至两面金黄色即可。","img":"images/613512/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/613512/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"对半切开，方便食用。","img":"images/613512/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}